    <string name="auto_lock_help">Locks the scooter once when it has stood still for 30 s and the Bluetooth signal gets weak. It never locks while the scooter moves, and the notification has an Unlock button. The signal varies with walls and pockets, so it can lock a bit early or late. It is not theft protection.</string>
